WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.728
The rules you’ll apply in the lab.

2
00:00:02.008 --> 00:00:06.723
Collect less: ids and numbers by default, content only by policy.

3
00:00:07.003 --> 00:00:09.136
Pseudonymize users with a keyed hash.

4
00:00:09.416 --> 00:00:16.349
Redact every captured value in one shared function, count what it redacts, and test the exits as well as the function.

5
00:00:16.629 --> 00:00:24.501
Know its false negatives, and protect the content tier with access control and short retention because the redactor will miss things.

6
00:00:24.781 --> 00:00:29.005
Know what your provider keeps, what your arrangement covers, and the date you checked.

7
00:00:29.285 --> 00:00:36.795
The lab’s records follow these rules, and the validator rejects a record whose preview still contains something the redactor would catch.
